cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "SpineRankNet"
abstract: >-
  Code for "Be Indiscrete: The Benefits of Learning Continuous Spine
  Degeneration Severity Scores" (MICCAI 2026). SpineRankNet learns a
  continuous severity score in [0, 10] for each of 11 lumbar spine MRI
  grading tasks, using a severity-aware pairwise ranking loss (SpineRank) on
  top of a 3D ResNet-18 multi-task classifier. Thresholds on the score recover
  the ordinal clinical grade.
